<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-IAM sees A$19.6 mln 96/97 net profit.</title>
<headline>RTRS-IAM sees A$19.6 mln 96/97 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pastoral services group IAMA Ltd said on Wednesday that it forecast 1996/97 net profit of A$19.6 million compared with A$15.5 million in the latest year to September 30.</p>
<p>IAMA said sales would rise to A$912.8 million in the current year from A$787.7 million in 1995/96.</p>
<p>The company said the forecasts did not include any contribution from pastoral house Primac Holdings Ltd which is the subject of a hostile share-swap takeover bid.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
